</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name></person-group><year>1984</year><article-title>Aspartame metabolism in animals</article-title><source>Aspartame Physiology and Biochemistry</source><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Marcel Dekker</publisher-name><fpage>141</fpage><lpage>159</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b26-ehp0115-001293"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Soffritti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Acesulfame potassium: Soffritti responds [Letter]</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>114</volume><fpage>A516</fpage><lpage>A517</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16966071</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b27-ehp0115-001293"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Soffritti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Belpoggi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Cevolani</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Guarino</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Padovani</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Maltoni</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002a</year><article-title>Results of long-term experimental studies on the carcinogenicity of methyl alcohol and ethyl alcohol in rats</article-title><source>Ann NY Acad Sci</source><volume>982</volume><fpage>46</fpage><lpage>69</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12562628</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b28-ehp0115-001293"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Soffritti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Belpoggi</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Degli Esposti</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lambertini</surname><given-names>L</given-name